1 NOTE {geni:about_me} PURURAVA  WAS VERY VIRTIOUS KING AND BECAME ONE OF THE SIX WORLD MONARCHS. HE ESTABLISHED THE CITY OF PRAYAG WHICH LATER BECAME THE CAPITAL OF HIS KINGDOM.PURURAVA HELPED INDRA TO DEFEAT MIGHTY DEMONKESHI AND ATTRA
2 CONC CTED BY HIS VIRTUES,  URVASHI APPROACHED HIM WITH A DESIRE TO MARRY HIM. PURURAVA WELCOMED URVASHI AND TOGETHER THEY BEGET SIX SONS. AYU, SHRUTAYU, RAY, VIJAY AND JAY.
