2 CONC the king, and wanted him to marry her. She told him that she belonged to a royal family, and Yayati could marry her. Yayati agreed and they wed in secret. They continued to meet and hid the fact from Devayani that they were marrie
2 CONC d. Yayati had two sons from Devayani, Yaduand Turvasu. Yayati also had three sons from Sharmishtha, Druhyu, Anu and Puru.
